{"name":"Purple Toolbox","hex":"#746cc0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"purple","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A colour between red and blue; violet, though often closer to magenta.","Any non-spectral colour on the line of purples on a colour chromaticity diagram or a colour wheel between violet and red."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a purple hue.","Not predominantly red or blue, but having a mixture of Democrat and Republican support."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/purple"},{"term":"toolbox","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A storage case for tools.","A set of pre-existing routines for use in writing new programs."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/toolbox"}],"entries":[{"title":"Toolbox","blocks":[{"text":"A toolbox is a box to organize, carry, and protect the owner's tools. They could be used for trade, a hobby or DIY, and their contents vary with the craft."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/%22site_toolbox_Armorgard_TuffBank_London_construction_site_20_November_2019.jpg%22.jpg/330px-%22site_toolbox_Armorgard_TuffBank_London_construction_site_20_November_2019.jpg%22.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toolbox"},{"title":"Purple","blocks":[{"text":"Purple is a color similar in appearance to violet light. In the RYB color model historically used in the arts, purple is a secondary color created by combining red and blue pigments. In the CMYK color model used in modern printing, purple is made by combining magenta pigment with cyan pigment, black pigment, or both. In the RGB color model used in computer and television screens, purple is created by mixing red and blue light in order to create colors that appear similar to violet light. According to color theory, purple is considered a cool color."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Iris_sanguinea_cultivar%2C_Wakehurst_Place%2C_UK_-_Diliff.jpg/330px-Iris_sanguinea_cultivar%2C_Wakehurst_Place%2C_UK_-_Diliff.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purple"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Ty%C3%B6kalulaatikko%2C_joka_on_ollut_ty%C3%B6ntekij%C3%A4n_matkassa_turbiinien_ja_puuhiomakoneiden_asennusteht%C3%A4viss%C3%A4_1950-luvulla._Tampellan_konepaja%2C_Tampere._Tampereen_museot._Kuva_Reetta_Tervakangas%2C_Vapriikin_kuva-arkisto._%2816431673676%29.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Ty%C3%B6kalulaatikko%2C_joka_on_ollut_ty%C3%B6ntekij%C3%A4n_matkassa_turbiinien_ja_puuhiomakoneiden_asennusteht%C3%A4viss%C3%A4_1950-luvulla._Tampellan_konepaja%2C_Tampere._Tampereen_museot._Kuva_Reetta_Tervakangas%2C_Vapriikin_kuva-arkisto._%2816431673676%29.jpg/1280px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Ty%C3%B6kalulaatikko%2C_joka_on_ollut_ty%C3%B6ntekij%C3%A4n_matkassa_turbiinien_ja_puuhiomakoneiden_asennusteht%C3%A4viss%C3%A4_1950-luvulla._Tampellan_konepaja%2C_Tampere._Tampereen_museot._Kuva_Reetta_Tervakangas%2C_Vapriikin_kuva-arkisto._%2816431673676%29.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Simple wooden toolbox","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATy%C3%B6kalulaatikko%2C_joka_on_ollut_ty%C3%B6ntekij%C3%A4n_matkassa_turbiinien_ja_puuhiomakoneiden_asennusteht%C3%A4viss%C3%A4_1950-luvulla._Tampellan_konepaja%2C_Tampere._Tampereen_museot._Kuva_Reetta_Tervakangas%2C_Vapriikin_kuva-arkisto._(16431673676).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Caisse_%C3%A0_outils_avec_petit_outillage.JPG/500px-Caisse_%C3%A0_outils_a